---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Dynamiq – Data Intelligence, OSINT & Monitoring"
description: "Data Intelligence, OSINT and continuous monitoring across web, social media, documents, video and internal data."
ogDescription: "Dynamiq collects, structures and connects data across social platforms, the public web, documents, video, audio and internal systems."
ogImage: /assets/og-image-data-intelligence.png
isHome: true
showNavigation: true
---
<section class="poster-hero" id="top" data-poster-hero aria-labelledby="poster-title">
  <div class="poster-hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="poster-hero__draw-surface" data-draw-surface aria-hidden="true">
    <canvas class="poster-hero__draw-canvas" data-draw-canvas></canvas>
    <span class="poster-hero__draw-hint" data-draw-hint>Make your mark.</span>
  </div>
  <p class="poster-hero__eyebrow" data-hero-reveal>SOCIAL · WEB · VIDEO · DATA</p>

  <h1 class="poster-title" id="poster-title" aria-label="FROM DATA TO CLEAR SIGNALS. BETTER DECISIONS.">
    <span class="poster-title__group poster-title__group--complex" data-hero-reveal data-depth="0.35">
      <span>FROM&nbsp;DATA </span>
      <span class="poster-title__outline">TO</span>
    </span>
    <span class="poster-title__group poster-title__group--clear" data-hero-reveal data-depth="0.62">
      <span>Clear</span>
      <span class="poster-title__serif">Signals.</span>
    </span>
    <span class="poster-title__group poster-title__group--better" data-hero-reveal data-depth="0.45">
      <span>Better</span>
      <span>DECISIONS.</span>
    </span>
  </h1>

  <div class="poster-objects" aria-label="Wie Dynamiq aus unstrukturierten Quellen Intelligence macht">
    <div class="poster-object poster-object--positioning" data-poster-object data-depth="0.9" data-hero-reveal>
      <div class="poster-object__face">
        <span class="poster-object__index">01</span>
        <strong data-sticker-text>COLLECT THE DATA</strong>
        <span class="poster-object__note">SOCIAL + PUBLIC WEB</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-object poster-object--story" data-poster-object data-depth="1.15" data-hero-reveal>
      <div class="poster-object__face">
        <span class="poster-object__index">02</span>
        <strong data-sticker-text>VIDEO BECOMES DATA</strong>
        <span class="poster-object__note">TRANSCRIBE + STRUCTURE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-object poster-object--growth" data-poster-object data-depth="0.75" data-hero-reveal>
      <div class="poster-object__face">
        <span class="poster-object__index">03</span>
        <strong data-sticker-text>CONNECT NETWORKS</strong>
        <span class="poster-object__note">ANALYZE + MONITOR</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="poster-hero__footer" data-hero-reveal>
    <a class="poster-hero__cta" href="#kontakt">Analyse besprechen <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="poster-hero__scroll" href="#datenquellen">Scroll zu den Datenquellen <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="deliverables" id="leistungen" aria-labelledby="deliverables-title">
  <div class="deliverables__inner section-shell">
    <header class="deliverables__intro">
      <p class="section-kicker">[ Was wir liefern ]</p>
      <div class="deliverables__heading">
        <h2 id="deliverables-title">Egal ob Rohdaten oder <span>Intelligence-System.</span></h2>
      </div>
    </header>

    <ol class="deliverables__grid" aria-label="Rohdaten, Analyse, Monitoring und Systeme">
      {% for deliverable in home.deliverables %}
        <li class="deliverable">
          <header class="deliverable__header">
            <span class="deliverable__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ deliverable.number }}</span>
            <p class="deliverable__label">{{ deliverable.label }}</p>
          </header>
          <p class="deliverable__text">{{ deliverable.text }}</p>
          <div class="deliverable__outputs">
            <p class="deliverable__outputs-title">Outputs</p>
            <ul>
              {% for output in deliverable.outputs %}<li>{{ output }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="data-sources" id="datenquellen" aria-labelledby="data-sources-title">
  <div class="data-sources__inner section-shell">
    <div class="ux-stat">
      <div class="ux-first source-formats">
        <h3 id="data-sources-title">Data is <span>not one format.</span></h3>
        <ul aria-label="Datenquellen"><li>TikTok · YouTube · Instagram</li><li>Reddit · X · LinkedIn</li><li>Forums · Imageboards · Public Channels</li><li>Video · Audio · Comments</li><li>Websites · Documents · Internal Data</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pipeline section-shell" aria-labelledby="pipeline-title">
  <div class="build-process">
    <header class="build-services__subhead">
      <p class="section-kicker">[ Intelligence Pipeline ]</p>
      <h3 id="pipeline-title">From raw content to structured intelligence.</h3>
    </header>
    <ol class="build-process__steps">
      {% for step in home.buildProcess %}
        <li>
          <div class="build-process__meta"><span>{{ step.number }}</span><strong>{{ step.label }}</strong></div>
          <h4>{{ step.title }}</h4>
          <p class="build-process__flow">{{ step.flow }}</p>
          <p class="build-process__text">{{ step.text }}</p>
          <ul class="build-tag-list" aria-label="Arbeitsschritte">{% for tag in step.tags %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="service-offer section-shell" aria-labelledby="offer-title" data-system-playgrounds>
  <header class="service-offer__intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">[ Technische Spezialisierung ]</p>
    <h2 id="offer-title"><span>Built for</span><span>difficult data.</span></h2>
    <p>Die technische Ebene hinter den Ergebnissen: belastbare Erfassung, multimodale Verarbeitung, prüfbare Analyse und Systeme für den laufenden Betrieb.</p>
  </header>

  <ol class="capability-list">
    {% for service in home.capabilities %}
      <li class="capability-row" data-system-row>
        <span class="capability-row__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ service.number }}</span>
        <div class="capability-row__title">
          <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-row__body">
          <p>{{ service.text }}</p>
          <ul class="build-tag-list" aria-label="Leistungsbausteine">
            {% for tag in service.tags %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% include "components/system-playground.njk" %}
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>

</section>

<section class="references" id="referenzen" aria-labelledby="references-title">
  <div class="references__inner section-shell">
    <header class="references__intro">
      <p class="section-kicker">[ Referenzen ]</p>
      <h2 id="references-title"><span>Die Quelle ändert sich.</span><span>Die Pipeline bleibt.</span></h2>
      <p>Dokumente, Social Video und Marktdaten brauchen unterschiedliche Collection-Methoden – aber dieselbe Sorgfalt beim Strukturieren, Verbinden, Analysieren und Verifizieren.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="reference-list">
      {% for reference in home.references %}
        <li class="reference-row">
          <span class="reference-row__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ reference.number }}</span>
          <div class="reference-row__source">
            <p>{{ reference.source }}</p>
            <strong>{{ reference.metric }}</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="reference-row__body">
            <h3>{{ reference.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ reference.text }}</p>
            {% if reference.detail %}<p class="reference-row__detail">{{ reference.detail }}</p>{% endif %}
            <ul class="build-tag-list" aria-label="Eingesetzte Fähigkeiten">{% for tag in reference.tags %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
            <a class="reference-row__link" href="{{ reference.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Golem-Artikel lesen <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-team section-shell" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <header class="about-team__intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">[ Team ]</p>
    <h2 id="team-title"><span>Menschen hinter</span><span>den Daten.</span></h2>
    <p>Ein kleines Team aus Softwareentwicklung, Datenanalyse und UX. Direkt in Collection, Research, Analyse und der Entwicklung belastbarer Intelligence-Systeme.</p>
  </header>
  <ol class="team-grid">
    {% for person in home.team %}
      <li class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card__media">
          {% if person.image %}
            <img src="{{ person.image }}" alt="{{ person.imageAlt }}" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" style="object-position: {{ person.imagePosition }};">
          {% else %}
            <div class="team-card__placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Neutraler Platzhalter für {{ person.name }}">
              <strong>{{ person.placeholder }}</strong>
              <span>Portrait folgt</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="team-card__content">
          <div class="team-card__meta"><span aria-hidden="true">[ {{ person.number }} ]</span>{% if person.status %}<strong>{{ person.status }}</strong>{% endif %}</div>
          <h3>{{ person.name }}</h3>
          <p class="team-card__role">{{ person.role }}</p>
          <p class="team-card__focus">{{ person.disciplines }}</p>
          <p class="team-card__description">{{ person.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <div class="team-combination">
    <h3>Software Engineering <span>+</span> Data Analysis <span>+</span> UX</h3>
    <p>Wir liefern nicht nur Research-Ergebnisse. Wir entwickeln auch die Interfaces, Pipelines und Monitoring-Systeme, mit denen Intelligence dauerhaft entsteht.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="kontakt" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="contact__inner section-shell">
    <header class="contact-intro">
      <p class="section-kicker">[ Kontakt ]</p>
      <h2 id="contact-title"><span>Was möchtet ihr</span><span>herausfinden?</span></h2>
    </header>
    <div class="contact-body">
      <div class="contact-summary">
        <p>Beschreibt uns die Frage, die Datenquelle oder das Signal, das ihr verstehen oder dauerhaft beobachten möchtet.</p>
        <p>Im ersten Gespräch klären wir Ziel, Quellen, vorhandene Daten und den passenden Scope.</p>
        <div class="contact-meta">
          <p class="contact-direct"><span>Lieber direkt per E-Mail?</span><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
          <span class="contact-note">Aus {{ site.location }}. Zusammenarbeit im {{ site.areaServed }}.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form class="contact-form" name="projektanfrage" method="post" action="/danke/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="projektanfrage">
        <p class="form-honeypot" hidden><label>Nicht ausfüllen: <input name="bot-field" type="text"></label></p>

        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field"><label for="name">Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="email">E-Mail <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
          <div class="field field-full"><label for="unternehmen">Unternehmen</label><input id="unternehmen" name="unternehmen" type="text" autocomplete="organization"></div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="leistung">Welche Unterstützung sucht ihr? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <select id="leistung" name="leistung" required>
              <option value="">Bitte auswählen</option>
              <option value="Rohdaten &amp; Data Collection">Rohdaten &amp; Data Collection</option>
              <option value="Analyse">Analyse</option>
              <option value="Monitoring">Monitoring</option>
              <option value="Individuelle Systeme">Individuelle Systeme</option>
              <option value="Noch nicht sicher">Noch nicht sicher</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="budget">Budgetrahmen (optional)</label>
            <select id="budget" name="budget">
            <option value="">Keine Angabe</option>
            <option>10.000–20.000 €</option>
            <option>20.000–40.000 €</option>
            <option>40.000–75.000 €</option>
            <option>75.000 € oder mehr</option></select>
          </div>
          <div class="field field-full"><label for="projekt">Worum geht es? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><textarea id="projekt" name="projekt" rows="6" required aria-describedby="projekt-hilfe"></textarea><span class="form-help" id="projekt-hilfe">Fragestellung, vorhandene Daten, relevante Quellen und gewünschtes Ergebnis genügen für den Anfang.</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="consent-field">
          <input id="datenschutz-zustimmung" name="datenschutz-zustimmung" type="checkbox" value="zugestimmt" required>
          <label for="datenschutz-zustimmung">Ich stimme zu, dass meine Angaben zur Bearbeitung der Anfrage verarbeitet werden. Weitere Informationen stehen in der <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzerklärung</a>. <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        </div>
        <p class="required-note"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> Pflichtfeld</p>
        <button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Analyse besprechen</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
